{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$id":"audit-event.schema.json","title":"AuditEvent（稽核事件，JSONL 的一行）","description":"docs/03 §13.1–13.2 [H]。append-only JSONL，每個 run 一個檔。prev_hash＝前一行原始位元組（UTF-8、不含換行）的 sha256；第一行＝sha256(run_id)。只有人為動作（initiator_claim、run_resume）帶 signature，簽署對象是移除 signature 後的事件（JCS）。","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,
"properties":{
"seq":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"從 1 起連續"},
"ts":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/datetime"},
"run_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/run_id"},
"engagement_id":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/engagement_id"},
"event_type":{"enum":[
 "run_created","run_status_changed","initiator_claim","run_resume","resume_expired","config_loaded",
 "key_registry_loaded","signature_verified","signature_invalid","engagement_verified","engagement_verify_failed","roe_verified","roe_verify_failed","ownership_check",
 "redaction_map_created","secret_detected","pii_detected",
 "llm_request","llm_response","llm_refused_policy","schema_repair","retry","missing_vote","fallback_used","relay_call",
 "commander_plan","policy_decision","coverage_floor_applied",
 "gate_opened","gate_decision","gate_expired","gate_skipped","gate_load_warning","spot_check_result",
 "budget_threshold","budget_exhausted",
 "artifact_stored","artifact_validation","verdict_changed",
 "sandbox_job_start","sandbox_job_end","tool_invocation_start","tool_invocation_end","session_login","egress_blocked","third_party_contact","job_skipped",
 "stop_condition","kill_switch","snapshot_created","snapshot_restored","restore_failed","restore_drill","seed_reset_failed","policy_violation",
 "feedback_recorded","report_published","followup_draft_created",
 "audit_anchor"]},
"actor":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"enum":["human","agent","system"]},"id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","id"]},
"node":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},
"zone":{"enum":["Z1","Z2","Z3","Z4"]},
"data_class":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/data_class"},
"idempotency_key":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[^:]+:[^:]+:.+$","description":"v0.4：必填，格式 run_id:node:<鍵>（docs/08 §6 的冪等鍵表）。前兩段必須等於事件的 run_id 與 node，同一個 run 內不重複（E-AUDIT-IDEMPOTENCY）；v0.3 可為 null，讀取時的去重因此做不到"},
"payload":{"type":"object","description":"小型結構化內容；secret_detected 只含位置與 hash，不含值"},
"payload_refs":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"},"description":"CAS hash（prompt、回應、請求紀錄）"},
"prev_hash":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/sha256"},
"signature":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/signature"},{"type":"null"}]}},
"required":["seq","ts","run_id","engagement_id","event_type","actor","node","zone","data_class","idempotency_key","payload","payload_refs","prev_hash","signature"],
"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"audit_anchor"}},"required":["event_type"]},"then":{"properties":{"payload":{"required":["reason","z3_countersignature"],"properties":{"reason":{"type":"string"},"z3_countersignature":{"$ref":"common.schema.json#/$defs/signature","description":"v0.4：Z3 Executor 服務金鑰（角色 z3_executor）的簽章（E-AUDIT-ANCHOR-SIG）；v0.5 簽的是 JCS({domain: vibecheck/audit_anchor/v2, run_id, seq, prev_hash, event_sha256})，event_sha256 蓋住錨點事件本身（去掉本欄位）；只控制 Z1 的人無法整條重寫"}}}}}}]}
